<title>UK: Rabobank sets $250 million four-year bond.</title>
<headline>Rabobank sets $250 million four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Nikko and Rabobank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RABOBANK</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	COUPON     6.25	MATURITY    30.JAN.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.341   PAY DATE    30.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    99.941    SPREAD	+2 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX/AMST  PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC  1.40	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGAMME.</p>
<p>	     UNSECURED, UNSUBORDINATED.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
